{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-3-1","title":"thm:dc-ch7-3-1","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.md","line":363,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex#thm:dc-ch7-3-1","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-2]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex","label":"thm:dc-ch7-3-1","line":628,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Hadamard theorem]\n\n  \\label{thm:dc-ch7-3-1}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch7-3-2, lem:dc-ch7-3-3, lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo, lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly, lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric, lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo, lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global, lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth, thm:dc-ch7-2-8}\n\n  \\dcref{ch7:3.1}\nLet $M$ be a complete Riemannian manifold, simply connected, with sectional\n  curvature $K(p,\\sigma)\\le 0$ for all $p\\in M$ and for all $\\sigma\\subset T_p(M)$.\n  Then $M$ is diffeomorphic to $\\mathbb{R}^n$, $n=\\dim M$; more precisely,\n  $\\exp_p:T_pM\\to M$ is a diffeomorphism.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch Nonpositive curvature makes the Jacobi energy strictly positive away from its initial zero, so $d\\exp_p$ is everywhere invertible and $\\exp_p$ is a local diffeomorphism. The pullback metric on $T_pM$ makes $\\exp_p$ metric-preserving; completeness and path lifting make it a covering map. Simple connectedness of $M$ makes the covering bijective, hence $\\exp_p$ is a diffeomorphism.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Hadamard theorem] <p></p><span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a64632d6368372d332d31\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-2\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-2</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-3\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-3</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-1-assembly\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-expmap-global\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23thm%3Adc-ch7-2-8\">↗ thm:dc-ch7-2-8</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch7:3.1</span></span>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> be a complete Riemannian manifold, simply connected, with sectional curvature <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$K(p,\\sigma )\\le 0$\">$K(p,\\sigma )\\le 0$</span> for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p\\in M$\">$p\\in M$</span> and for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\sigma \\subset T_p(M)$\">$\\sigma \\subset T_p(M)$</span>. Then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> is diffeomorphic to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathbb {R}^n$\">$\\mathbb {R}^n$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$n=\\dim M$\">$n=\\dim M$</span>; more precisely, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _p:T_pM\\to M$\">$\\exp _p:T_pM\\to M$</span> is a diffeomorphism.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch Nonpositive curvature makes the Jacobi energy strictly positive away from its initial zero, so <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d\\exp _p$\">$d\\exp _p$</span> is everywhere invertible and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _p$\">$\\exp _p$</span> is a local diffeomorphism. The pullback metric on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$T_pM$\">$T_pM$</span> makes <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _p$\">$\\exp _p$</span> metric-preserving; completeness and path lifting make it a covering map. Simple connectedness of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M$\">$M$</span> makes the covering bijective, hence <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _p$\">$\\exp _p$</span> is a diffeomorphism. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#cor:dc-ch7-2-10","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-2-no-conjugate","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-2","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-2","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-2"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth","label":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8","title":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8","label":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-3-1","title":"thm:dc-ch7-3-1","tex":"\\begin{theorem}[Hadamard theorem]\n\n  \\label{thm:dc-ch7-3-1}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch7-3-2, lem:dc-ch7-3-3, lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo, lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly, lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric, lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo, lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global, lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth, thm:dc-ch7-2-8}\n\n  \\dcref{ch7:3.1}\nLet $M$ be a complete Riemannian manifold, simply connected, with sectional\n  curvature $K(p,\\sigma)\\le 0$ for all $p\\in M$ and for all $\\sigma\\subset T_p(M)$.\n  Then $M$ is diffeomorphic to $\\mathbb{R}^n$, $n=\\dim M$; more precisely,\n  $\\exp_p:T_pM\\to M$ is a diffeomorphism.\n\\end{theorem}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch Nonpositive curvature makes the Jacobi energy strictly positive away from its initial zero, so $d\\exp_p$ is everywhere invertible and $\\exp_p$ is a local diffeomorphism. The pullback metric on $T_pM$ makes $\\exp_p$ metric-preserving; completeness and path lifting make it a covering map. Simple connectedness of $M$ makes the covering bijective, hence $\\exp_p$ is a diffeomorphism.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-2","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-2","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-3","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-3","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-covering-diffeo","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-1-assembly","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pullback-metric","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-4-pole-diffeo","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth","title":"lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-smooth","description":""},{"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8","title":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8","description":""}],"dependencies_omitted":0,"unresolved_dependencies":[],"unresolved_omitted":0}}